        "content": "<p>I am having trouble with my Permalink PID setup again. Due to historic reasons (<a href=\"https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/issues/10564\">https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/issues/10564</a> ) I have a legacy provider and a new permalink provider set up as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"JSON\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nt\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"OK\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nt\">\"data\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nt\">\"perma1\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"perma1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"label\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"PermaLink\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"protocol\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"perma\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"authority\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"thz\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"separator\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"shoulder\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"ds-\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"identifierGenerationStyle\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"randomString\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"datafilePidFormat\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"DEPENDENT\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"managedSet\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"excludedSet\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nt\">\"legacy\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"legacy\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"label\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"legacy\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"protocol\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"perma\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"authority\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"thz-\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"separator\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"shoulder\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"ds-\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"identifierGenerationStyle\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"random\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"datafilePidFormat\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"DEPENDENT\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"managedSet\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"nt\">\"excludedSet\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>On Dataverse 6.2 this worked fine, but somewhere during the Update to 6.6, the links pointing to datasets as well as in citation suggestion do not contain the <code>\"/\"</code> anymore:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>https://my.dataverse.de/citation?persistentId=perma:thzds-FOOBAR\ninstead of\nhttps://my.dataverse.de/citation?persistentId=perma:thz/ds-FOOBAR\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>When I add the slash to the URL manually I can still access the dataset, but all links used in the interface do not work. Does anyone have an Idea what is going wrong here?</p>",
